---
import { skills } from '../data/skills';
---
<section class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-6 pt-20 sm:pt-28 pb-16 sm:pb-24">
  <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-[var(--color-accent-warm)] mb-6">Made for GPT-6 Astra</p>
  <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-[80px] leading-[1.05] max-w-3xl">Make the next founder decision count.</h1>
  <p class="mt-7 text-lg max-w-xl leading-relaxed">{skills.length} focused skills for the work in front of you. Clearer copy, better customer questions, useful experiments and a release you can actually ship.</p>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Start with an outcome. See a worked example. Let Astra choose the steps.</p>
  <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
    <a href="#which-skill" class="rounded-full bg-[var(--color-text)] text-[var(--color-bg)] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium">Find your workflow</a>
    <a href="#install" class="rounded-full border border-[var(--color-border)] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium">Use in Codex</a>
  </div>
</section>
